{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Percent Calculators 是應 percent.info 網站訪客需求而開發的工具 App，提供簡潔、無干擾、快速且容易上手的百分比運算體驗。適合學生、辦公室工作者及日常需要處理百分比數字的人士。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>百分比計算功能</h2>\n<p>Percent Calculators 提供五種實用計算模式：計算某數的百分比、計算兩個數字之間的百分比變化、計算某數佔另一個數字的百分比、從某數減去百分比，以及為某數加上百分比。介面設計簡潔無干擾，運作快速，讓用家可以直觀地完成日常百分比運算。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-182-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-183-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-184-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-185-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-186-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-187-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Percent Calculators</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T05:59:14.859911+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":311,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}